WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:05.700
[Narrator:] This could be the story of the beginning of the end of rubella.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.780
The viral disease that causes congenital defects.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:14.120
In June 1969, the first rubella vaccine was licensed.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:18.140
This ended an eight-year search for a vaccine

00:00:18.145 --> 00:00:21.711
by scientists and physicians in university medical centers,

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.640
private industry, and government.

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:27.140
The first breakthrough came in 1961

00:00:27.145 --> 00:00:31.145
at Harvard and Walter Reed, with the simultaneous isolation

00:00:31.145 --> 00:00:34.680
and identification of the elusive rubella virus.

00:00:36.420 --> 00:00:40.778
By 1965, two scientists at the National Institutes of Health

00:00:40.778 --> 00:00:43.078
had developed an
experimental vaccine

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:48.020
which seemed to prevent rubella, yet not cause or transmit the disease.

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:52.978
Produced from live rubella virus, passed 77 times

00:00:52.978 --> 00:00:56.244
through green monkey kidney tissue cultures,

00:00:56.244 --> 00:01:00.120
the vaccine was called HPV 77.

00:01:00.745 --> 00:01:04.900
At NIH, the experimental vaccine was tested for purity

00:01:04.911 --> 00:01:07.577
and was grown in cell cultures in quantity

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:10.220
to permit extensive laboratory studies.

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:15.440
Before the vaccine could be given to humans,

00:01:15.445 --> 00:01:19.111
it was tested repeatedly in hundreds of laboratory animals

00:01:19.111 --> 00:01:22.144
by doctors Harry Meyer and Paul Parkman,

00:01:22.144 --> 00:01:27.120
the two NIH scientists who developed HPV 77.

00:01:31.345 --> 00:01:33.940
At the children's colony in Conway, Arkansas,

00:01:33.945 --> 00:01:36.511
the vaccine was first given to humans:

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:40.520
16 susceptible girls living in a quarantine cottage.

00:01:40.744 --> 00:01:43.400
After parents and school officials gave permission

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:46.420
for the study, eight girls were inoculated.

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:49.511
The others served as controls.

00:01:49.511 --> 00:01:51.444
The results were encouraging.

00:01:51.445 --> 00:01:54.911
The eight who were vaccinated developed high antibody levels

00:01:54.911 --> 00:01:58.644
but no symptoms, nor did they transmit the infection

00:01:58.644 --> 00:01:59.980
to the controls.

00:02:03.045 --> 00:02:06.940
But to speed the antibody tests, a new detection procedure

00:02:06.945 --> 00:02:07.978
was needed.

00:02:07.978 --> 00:02:11.144
Once again, the research of doctors Meyer and Parkman

00:02:11.145 --> 00:02:12.678
was successful.

00:02:12.678 --> 00:02:15.944
Their new technique, known as the HI test

00:02:15.945 --> 00:02:18.345
in the hands of qualified technicians,

00:02:18.345 --> 00:02:21.611
now makes possible the reliable measurement

00:02:21.611 --> 00:02:24.544
of rubella antibody titers in three hours.

00:02:24.545 --> 00:02:27.578
Previous tests required three weeks

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.600
and were far too complex for general use.

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:38.845
In 1967, the federal government began its massive field trials

00:02:38.845 --> 00:02:42.460
in the cities from Danbury, Connecticut to Los Angeles.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:48.040
Inoculations were given, detailed records were kept on vaccinees and controls,

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:52.200
and follow-up blood studies gave evidence of antibody response.

00:02:55.445 --> 00:02:57.740
Similar studies were done on Taiwan,

00:02:57.745 --> 00:03:01.945
where the vaccine proved 90 percent effective during an epidemic.

00:03:01.945 --> 00:03:05.545
In all, the trials involved scores of physicians, nurses,

00:03:05.545 --> 00:03:09.460
laboratory technicians, and nearly 50,000 children.

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:15.240
Now with an approved vaccine,

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:19.360
prospects are good that the birth defects of rubella can be eliminated.

00:03:19.645 --> 00:03:22.040
It depends on the medical profession

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:23.940
and the parents of America.

